  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Functional Physical Rehabilitation of Health Services Stage I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Funcional Rehabilitacin Fsica y Servicios Salud I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM&apos;S OBJECTIVE IS TO IMPROVE THE QUALITY AND COVERAGE OF HEALTH CARE SERVICES, AND IS AIMED TOWARD THE MOST VULNERABLE AND POOREST POPULATION GROUPS IN THE COUNTRY. THE PROGRAM CALLS FOR: THE REHABILITATION, CONSTRUCTION AND EQUIPMENT OF APPROXIMATELY 6 GENERAL HOSPITALS; IMPROVEMENT OF HOSPITAL MANAGEMENT; DESIGNING AND IMPLEMENTING MAINTENANCE SYSTEM FOR HEALTH FACILITIES AND EQUIPMENT; AND PREINVESTMENT STUDIES FOR THE FOLLOWING STAGES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
